{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-1","title":"Ezekiel 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Ezekiel eats the roll. 4 God encourages him. 15 God shews him the rule of prophecy. 22 God shuts and opens the prophet's mouth.</p>\n<p>eat.This must have passed in a vision; but the meaning is plain: Receive ny word into thy mind, let it enter into they soul; digest it, let it be they nourishment, they meat and thy drink, to do the will of thy Father who is in heaven.</p>\n<p>10; 2:8,9; 1Ti 4:15; Re 10:9,10 go. 11,15,17-21; 2:3; Jer 24:1-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-2","title":"Ezekiel 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Jer 25:17; Ac 26:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-3","title":"Ezekiel 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>and fill. 2:10; Job 32:18,19; Jer 6:11; 20:9; Joh 7:38; Col 3:16 Then. Ps 119:11; Jer 15:16; Joh 6:53-63 it was. Job 23:12; Ps 19:10; 119:97,103; Pr 2:10,11; Re 10:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-4","title":"Ezekiel 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>11; 2:3,7; Mt 10:5,6; 15:24; Ac 1:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-5","title":"Ezekiel 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>thou. Jon 1:2; 3:2-4; Ac 26:17,18 of a strange speech and of an hard language. Heb. deep oflip and heavy of tongue: and so. 6; Ps 81:5; Isa 33:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-6","title":"Ezekiel 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>of a strange speech and of an hard language. Heb. deep oflip and heavy of language. Surely, etc. or, If I had sent thee to them, would they not have hearkened? etc. Jon 3:5-10; Mt 11:20-24; 12:41,42; Lu 11:30-32; Ac 27:28 Ro 9:30-33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-7","title":"Ezekiel 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Israel will. 1Sa 8:7; Jer 25:3,4; 44:4,5,16; Lu 10:16; 13:34; 19:14; Joh 5:40-47 Joh 15:20-24 all the. 2:4; 24:7; Isa 3:9; Jer 3:3; 5:3 impudent and hard-hearted. Heb. stiff of forehead and hardof heart.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-8","title":"Ezekiel 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Ex 4:15,16; 11:4-8; 1Ki 21:20; Isa 50:7; Jer 1:18; 15:20; Mic 3:8 Ac 7:51-56; Heb 11:27,32-37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-9","title":"Ezekiel 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>adamant. Zec 7:12 fear. 2:6; Isa 41:10,14; 50:7; Jer 1:8,17; 17:18; Mic 3:8; 1Ti 2:3 2Ti 2:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-10","title":"Ezekiel 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>receive. 1-3; 2:8; Job 22:22; Ps 119:11; Pr 8:10; 19:20; Lu 8:15; 1Th 2:13 1Th 4:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-11","title":"Ezekiel 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>get. 15; 11:24,25; Da 6:13 the children. 33:2,12,17,30; 37:18; Ex 32:7; De 9:12; Da 12:1 speak. 27; 2:5,7; Ac 20:26,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-12","title":"Ezekiel 3:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>spirit. 14; 2:2; 8:3; 11:1,24; 40:1,2; 1Ki 18:12; 2Ki 2:16; Ac 8:39 a voice. Ac 2:2; Re 1:10,15 Blessed. Ps 72:18,19; 103:20,21; 148:2; Isa 6:3; Re 5:11-14; 19:6 glory. 9:3; 10:4,18,19; 11:22,23; Ex 40:34,35; 1Sa 4:21,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-13","title":"Ezekiel 3:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>the noise. 1:24; 10:5; 2Sa 5:24 touched. Heb. kissed. and the noise. 10:16,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-14","title":"Ezekiel 3:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the spirit. 12; 8:3; 37:1 in bitterness, in the heat of my spirit. Heb. bitter in hotanger. Nu 11:11-19; Jer 6:11; 20:14-18; Joh 4:1,3,9 but. 1:3; 8:1; 37:1; 1Ki 18:46; 2Ki 2:16; 3:15; Jer 20:7-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-15","title":"Ezekiel 3:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>that dwelt. 23; 1:1; 10:15; 43:3 sat. Ge 50:10; Job 2:13; Ps 137:1; Jer 23:9; Hab 3:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-17","title":"Ezekiel 3:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>I have. 33:2-9; 1Co 12:28 a watchman. So 3:3; 5:7; Isa 21:6,8,11,12; 52:8; 56:10; 62:6; Jer 6:17; 31:6 Ac 20:28-31; Heb 13:17 hear. 33:6-8; 2Ch 19:10; Isa 58:1; Jer 6:10; Hab 2:1; Mt 3:7; 1Co 4:14 2Co 5:11,20; Col 1:28; 1Th 5:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-18","title":"Ezekiel 3:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>I say. 18:4,13,20; 33:6,8; Ge 2:17; 3:3,4; Nu 26:65; 2Ki 1:4; Isa 3:11 Lu 13:3,5; Eph 5:5,6 to save. 18:30-32; Ac 2:40; 3:19; 1Ti 4:16; Jas 5:19,20 the same. 33:6,9,10; Pr 14:32; Joh 8:21,24 but. 34:10; Ge 9:5,6; 42:22; 2Sa 4:11; Lu 11:50,51; Ac 20:26,27 1Ti 5:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-19","title":"Ezekiel 3:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>if thou. 2Ki 17:13-23; 2Ch 36:15,16; Pr 29:1; Jer 42:19-22; 44:4,5 Lu 10:10,11; Ac 18:5,6; 1Th 4:6; Heb 2:1-3; 12:25 he shall. 18; 2Th 1:8,9; Heb 10:26,27 but thou. 21; 14:14,20; 33:5,9; Isa 49:4,5; Ac 13:45,46; 20:26; 2Co 2:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-20","title":"Ezekiel 3:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>When. 18:24,26; 33:12,13; 2Ch 24:2,17-22; Ps 36:3; 125:5; Zep 1:6 Mt 13:20,21; Heb 10:38; 2Pe 2:18-22; 1Jo 2:19 righteousness. Heb. righteousnesses. Isa 64:6; Da 9:18 and I lay. 7:19; 14:3,7-9; De 13:3; Ps 119:165; *marg: Isa 8:14; Jer 6:21; Lu 2:34; Ro 9:32,33; 11:9; 1Co 1:23; 2Th 2:9-12 1Pe 2:8 because. 18; Le 19:17; 2Sa 12:7-13; 2Ch 19:2-4; 25:15; Pr 25:12; Mt 18:15 and his. 18:24,26; 33:12,13; Mt 12:43-45; Lu 8:15; Ro 2:7,8; Heb 10:38 2Pe 2:21 but his. 18; 33:6; Heb 13:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-21","title":"Ezekiel 3:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>if thou. Mt 24:24,25; Ac 20:31; 1Co 4:14; 10:12; Ga 1:6-10; 5:2-7 Eph 4:17-21; 5:5,6; Col 1:28; 3:5-8; 1Th 4:6-8; 5:14; Tit 2:15 1Jo 3:6-9; Re 3:19 he shall. 20; Ps 19:11; Pr 9:9; 17:10; Ga 2:11-13; Jas 5:20 also. 19; 1Ti 4:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-22","title":"Ezekiel 3:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>the hand. 14; 1:3; 37:1 Arise. 8:4; Ac 9:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-23","title":"Ezekiel 3:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>the glory. 1:4,28; 9:3; 10:18; Nu 16:19,42; Ac 7:55 river. 1:1-3 and I fell. 1:28; Da 8:17; 10:8,9; Re 1:17; 4:10; 5:8,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-24","title":"Ezekiel 3:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>the spirit. 2:2; 37:10; Da 10:8-10,19 Go. 4:1-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-25","title":"Ezekiel 3:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>4:8; Mr 3:21; Joh 21:18; Ac 9:16; 20:23; 21:11-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-26","title":"Ezekiel 3:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>I will. 24:27; Ps 51:15; 137:6; Jer 1:17; Lu 1:20-22 and shalt. Ps 36:11,12; La 2:9; Ho 4:17; Am 5:10; 8:11,12; Mic 3:6,7 a reprover. Heb. a man reproving. for. 2:3-8; Isa 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-3-27","title":"Ezekiel 3:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>I will. 11:25; 24:27; 29:21; 33:32; Ex 4:11,12; Lu 21:15; Eph 6:19 Thus. 11; 2:5; Mt 11:15; 13:9; Re 22:10,11 for they. 9,26; 12:2,3</p>"}]}